R(1,n) FORMULA: exact pattern
  R(1,n) = 1 + 4/(n-2) = (n+2)/(n-2)
  n=3: R(1)=5  (formula check: 5, match=True)
  n=4: R(1)=3  (formula check: 3, match=True)
  n=5: R(1)=7/3  (formula check: 7/3, match=True)
  n=6: R(1)=2  (formula check: 2, match=True)
  n=7: R(1)=9/5  (formula check: 9/5, match=True)
  n=8: R(1)=5/3  (formula check: 5/3, match=True)
  n=9: R(1)=11/7  (formula check: 11/7, match=True)
